1:10	compose:mutable-state-autoboxing	manual	Using mutableIntStateOf is recommended over mutableStateOf<Int>, as it uses the Int primitive directly which is more performant.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#use-mutablestateof-type-specific-variants-when-possible for more information.
